        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "Sea Patrol. Here to interrogate me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "'Interrogate.' Ha. I never thought I'd have anything to do with that word."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "You should have thought of that when you intruded on the lab."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "What about before then? What makes you and I so different?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "Why 'interrogate' me? What have I done to deserve being 'questioned'?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "At times like these, I feel like our methods are too gentle."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "According to our envoy from Iberia, they're more than happy to incorporate punishment into the process."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "....."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "So if you're finished talking nonsense, state your identity."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "I'm a former road-side coral breeder."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Motive?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "You ever paid close attention to the coral by the road, Patroller?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "We hoped every cluster on every street would take on a different form or color, even different capabilities."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "Transport tubes pass through the cavity-filled cluster on the east side of the Sophontheatrum, and under the glimmering tubes, the polyps glimmer back. A patchwork of dots of light..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "Like a nebula in miniature."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "Then there's the ones around the port\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "As it happens, I <i>have</i> been paying close attention to some road-side coral recently. Specifically, the ones growing in your experimental field."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Where an innocent data scientist died."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "....."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Her dreams, her obsession, her love for her seaweeds... were as beautiful as the coral you speak of."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "But you murdered her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "You asked a good question earlier. What makes you and her so different?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "So why are you still alive? What did she do to deserve death?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "She found..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Found what? Speak up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Or are you implying I should be asking Cassia this question?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "What is the Church planning against the Waterway Program?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Will you be attacking the beacon, or the weapons?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Speak."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "*sigh* Church this, cultist that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "I'm still not used to being called names like that. You sure they're not just convenient excuses for you to arrest people?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "....."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "This so-called 'Church' and its 'cultists.' What part of them is 'holy,' exactly?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "I don't worship any kind of imaginary entity. I just agree with how Cassia sees things."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "From the despair engulfing \u00c6gir, she can see this nation's fragile nature."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "People place too much importance on the value of things, but are unwilling to recognize how fickle these values really are. They've become worshipers at their altar."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "But now, those values are crumbling away. Before \u00c6gir falls completely into despair, someone must sound the alarm\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "all"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_penrustle",
            "volume": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "Perii! You're just trying to loosen my lips!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Wounded 'Researcher",
        "text": "You won't get another word out of me. If you're feeling impatient, go ahead, scan my brainwaves. You won't get anything out of that either\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 30,
            "ystrength": 30,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4137_udflow_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Questioning you is the last respect I'll give you as a human being, scumbag!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Maybe you believe yourself innocent, and your actions free of conspiracy. But you <i>will</i> tell me everything I want to know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Secunda",
        "text": "Now speak."
    },
    {
