        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#3",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#3",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Captain."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "It's almost time for us to leave, Skadi."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#3",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I know it's urgent."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "The frontline is barely holding ground against the Seaborn. The loss of two entire fleets is really hitting us hard now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "According to their most recent missive, Legions VIII and X failed to regroup into formation, and they are now mired in a bitter struggle."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "If the beacon cannot be deployed at the designated position within the nest, and the deadlock continues... it will mean the failure of the Waterway Program."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#9",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "The Legion fleets are about to launch an offensive across the entire front, at all costs. All to attract the Seaborn's attention. As for us\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#3",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Squeeze through the battlefield, infiltrate the nest, and deploy the beacon."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Correct. How would you rate your current condition, Skadi?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#5",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I got some good sleep, at least. My first dreamless sleep since our last campaign."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "The situation in the city is getting more restive... Do you know where the Doctor has gone?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#3",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "(Shakes head)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I know you want me to keep the peace and protect the Doctor, Captain... You want me to stay."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "To be honest, I am conflicted."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Cleansing the sea of its dregs is our duty, but I am also responsible for your safety."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Have there been any signs of Ishar'mla stirring since we returned to sea?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#3",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "If it has, it's been real quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "If it speaks up, I'll shut it up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Actually, I've got something to say to you, Captain."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#8",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "We've never been this cautious in our work before. We had our ways of handling this sort of thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "If the Church's god\u2014the one the scum call 'Ishar'mla'\u2014really is inside me, then if I ever go out of control, I want you to execute me on the spot. Simple as that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "My heart's right here. I trust you won't miss."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#5",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Skadi\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "char_263_skadi#8",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I'm not finished."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "If you or Shark start to fall under their influence in battle before I do, I won't hesitate either."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "....."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_474_gladiia_1#3",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "What I was <i>going</i> to say is that, with war close at hand, I can imagine nothing more reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gladiia",
        "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
