    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#12$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "No need for that dreary honorific, little bird. We're not strangers, are we?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "...Laurentina."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "Considering how long we've been in this city, I'm surprised this is the first time we've run into one another. This is sad."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "I've always wanted to take our brave little warrior out on a real hunt in the depths. Sadly, the nest we're headed to is too far and too deep. No way to bring you along."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "It's alright. Even if I had the option, I'd stay in Milliarium regardless."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "There's been a lot happening in the city lately."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "The first time I wore deep-water equipment and entered the ocean, I was immediately knocked about by the current. I hate to admit it, but I'd be dead weight out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#12$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "No need to talk like that. The first time is always rough."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "Anyway, I can do a lot more in the city than in that nest."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "And once you've completed your mission and \u00c6gir's weapon systems start cleansing the area, I'll have to return to Saint Carmen and make an urgent report on why the sea surface has changed."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#6$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "Ah, so you meant we were to be parted once more."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "I'd be offering you all farewell gifts, but I wasn't expecting this before we left for Milliarium, so I have nothing to give."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "right",
            "name": "avg_1023_ghost2_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "Don't worry about it. We'll meet again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Specter",
        "text": "While we won't be needing to drag you from the sea half-drowned this time, I have a feeling our next reunion will be unforgettable in its own right."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "left",
            "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#3$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "*cough*! ...Oh, look, Skadi and Gladiia are coming!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Irene",
        "text": "Take care of yourself, Laurentina."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
