    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#8$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
            "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Seems you got the evidence you wanted.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#8$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Yes. You've been of great assistance."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "So, what's the verdict?;Not going to fill me in?",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "As previously mentioned, there are unusual data interactions between the beacon within the city and the ones deployed in the nests."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "It seems the bulk of the work was handled by Lab C-22. Namely, the facility we just infiltrated."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "While I do not fully understand the principles behind the beacon system or the Class IV weapons, the contents of these interactions can still be inferred."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "The coordination between the beacons and the weapons has been altered."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "As I surmised, the Waterway Program has been infiltrated at the highest level."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "'As I surmised.';Did you doubt the program from the start?",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Even before it was conceived, I had my doubts about \u00c6gir."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "From where?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "...That decisive campaign."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You were meant to kill the Firstborn.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "But you lost contact with your team.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Skadi was left to take the burden.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "...So you already know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Skadi trusts you more than expected."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I put it together from what she said.;She's not sure what happened herself.",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "My dereliction was due to a moment of distraction."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "In a cave, or rather, a cavity closest to Ishar'mla's core, I noticed something that should not be there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Crude piles of meat, turbid mucus. At first, I assumed they were nodules of its body, but then I saw clearly the measuring scales and flow channels around them..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "A corroded water flow meter."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "One from \u00c6gir. A design hundreds of years old, one that now exists only in museums."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Hundreds of years old?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Based on the degradation, it had sat within Ishar'mla's body for two centuries."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "But I had been told that no other \u00c6gir had ever managed to reach the Firstborn before us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "That is to say, before \u00c6gir was even aware of it, its people had secretly come into contact with the Firstborn."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "The undercurrents beneath tranquil \u00c6gir are more turbulent than anyone could imagine."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I also found something odd while you were out.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "As soon as the Hunters awoke, they left.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "They are being used to break the deadlock at the front."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "I can imagine the mission they have been assigned. Bypass the front lines, advance to the nest, and deploy the beacon."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "First support, now the linchpin? It's too quick.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "....."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "The advisor seemed more anxious than them.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "He left the lab at the first opportunity.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Blandus."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "Then I fear we, too, must act as quickly as possible."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "If the coordination between the beacons and weapons has been tampered with, then there is only one place to go: the core of the Waterway Program. The beacon launcher."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ulpianus",
        "text": "As for you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "focus": "n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I'll go see the one who gave the order.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Consul Clementia.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
